OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fclearer spells possible in the west
OL,7,Fthis evening, but otherwise a cloudy
OL,8,Fnight with patchy light rain, turning
OL,9,Fa little more persistent through the
OL,10,Fearly hours. Light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA largely cloudy day with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of mainly light rain and
OL,14,Fdrizzle slowly dying out. Winds
OL,15,Fremaining light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
