OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLittle
OL,6,Fchange through into next week, often
OL,7,Fcloudy with patchy drizzle in east,
OL,8,Fthe best of sunnier spells in west.
OL,9,FMainly light winds, but a freshening
OL,10,Fsoutheasterly later in west.
